{"name": "s3", "dur": 40.73, "lines": [{"id": "k01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.6, "clip": 0.28, "text": "发布会上的速度翻倍，", "ch": [0.35, 0.475, 0.6, 0.725, 0.85, 0.975, 1.1, 1.225, 1.35, 1.475], "sub": null, "big": "发布会上的速度翻倍，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "k02", "t0": 2.0, "t1": 3.07, "clip": 1.94, "text": "到手可能打对折。", "ch": [2.0, 2.134, 2.268, 2.401, 2.535, 2.669, 2.802, 2.936], "sub": null, "big": "到手可能打对折。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "k03", "t0": 3.47, "t1": 6.98, "clip": 3.42, "text": "AI 芯片的新闻也一样，天天在说速度翻倍。先问三句。", "ch": [3.47, 3.599, 3.727, 3.856, 3.985, 4.114, 4.242, 4.371, 4.5, 4.628, 4.757, 4.886, 5.014, 5.155, 5.295, 5.436, 5.576, 5.716, 5.857, 5.997, 6.138, 6.278, 6.418, 6.559, 6.699, 6.84], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "k04", "t0": 7.43, "t1": 11.74, "clip": 7.38, "text": "第一句：在什么路上跑的？就像千兆宽带，到你卧室可能只剩一半。", "ch": [7.43, 7.558, 7.685, 7.813, 8.09, 8.209, 8.328, 8.446, 8.565, 8.684, 8.803, 8.921, 9.22, 9.357, 9.494, 9.631, 9.769, 9.906, 10.043, 10.43, 10.549, 10.668, 10.787, 10.906, 11.025, 11.145, 11.264, 11.383, 11.502, 11.621], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "k05", "t0": 12.19, "t1": 16.64, "clip": 12.14, "text": "同样写着 224G，有的能推过一米长的铜缆，有的只跑几厘米。", "ch": [12.19, 12.344, 12.498, 12.652, 12.806, 12.96, 13.114, 13.268, 13.422, 13.576, 13.85, 13.983, 14.117, 14.25, 14.383, 14.517, 14.65, 14.783, 14.917, 15.05, 15.183, 15.317, 15.57, 15.704, 15.838, 15.971, 16.105, 16.239, 16.373, 16.506], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "k06", "t0": 17.09, "t1": 24.25, "clip": 17.04, "text": "第二句：费不费电？就像手机，跑分越高，越容易烫手掉电。几万颗芯片一起跑，电费就是真金白银。", "ch": [17.09, 17.249, 17.408, 17.567, 17.726, 17.886, 18.045, 18.204, 18.363, 18.522, 18.681, 18.84, 18.999, 19.158, 19.318, 19.477, 19.636, 19.795, 19.954, 20.113, 20.272, 20.431, 20.59, 20.75, 20.909, 21.068, 21.227, 21.386, 21.545, 21.704, 21.863, 22.022, 22.182, 22.341, 22.5, 22.659, 22.818, 22.977, 23.136, 23.295, 23.454, 23.614, 23.773, 23.932, 24.091], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "k07", "t0": 24.7, "t1": 29.64, "clip": 24.65, "text": "第三句：真机测过没有？发布会上的续航，和你到手的续航，常常是两回事。", "ch": [24.7, 24.837, 24.975, 25.113, 25.39, 25.527, 25.664, 25.801, 25.939, 26.076, 26.213, 26.55, 26.67, 26.79, 26.91, 27.03, 27.15, 27.27, 27.39, 27.6, 27.718, 27.835, 27.953, 28.07, 28.188, 28.305, 28.423, 28.65, 28.791, 28.933, 29.074, 29.216, 29.357, 29.499], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "k08", "t0": 30.69, "t1": 31.44, "clip": 30.63, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [30.69, 30.815, 30.94, 31.065, 31.19, 31.315], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "k09", "t0": 31.69, "t1": 35.66, "clip": 31.63, "text": "下次看到速度翻倍，先问：什么路？费不费电？实测了吗？", "ch": [31.69, 31.827, 31.963, 32.1, 32.237, 32.373, 32.51, 32.647, 32.783, 33.14, 33.29, 33.44, 33.7, 33.828, 33.955, 34.083, 34.41, 34.516, 34.622, 34.728, 34.834, 35.11, 35.22, 35.33, 35.44, 35.55], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "k10", "t0": 35.91, "t1": 39.13, "clip": 35.85, "text": "下一条：信号上路以后，为什么会越跑越模糊？", "ch": [35.91, 36.063, 36.217, 36.37, 36.523, 36.677, 36.83, 36.983, 37.137, 37.29, 37.443, 37.597, 37.75, 37.903, 38.057, 38.21, 38.363, 38.517, 38.67, 38.823, 38.977], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "launch", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "k01", "t1": 7.13}, {"kind": "wifi", "t0": 7.13, "paper": false, "first": "k04", "t1": 11.89}, {"kind": "cable", "t0": 11.89, "paper": false, "first": "k05", "t1": 16.79}, {"kind": "hot", "t0": 16.79, "paper": false, "first": "k06", "t1": 24.4}, {"kind": "ppt", "t0": 24.4, "paper": false, "first": "k07", "t1": 30.39}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 30.39, "paper": true, "first": "k08", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "k08", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "什么路？费不费电？", "line": "k09", "from": "什么路", "to": "费不费电"}, {"text": "实测了吗？", "line": "k09", "from": "实测", "to": "了吗"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 40.73}], "hudIn": 7.13